OL,3,GNEWSATuring's legacy honoured 100 years
OL,4,Aon from school
OL,5,
OL,6,FA century after Alan Turing first
OL,7,Farrived at a Dorset school as a boy, a
OL,8,Fnew generation of young people has
OL,9,Fgathered to explore the pioneering
OL,10,Fmathematician's legacy.
OL,12,FTuring was 13 when he started at
OL,13,FSherborne School in 1926, long before
OL,14,Fhis work breaking Nazi German codes
OL,15,Fduring World War Two helped change the
OL,16,Fcourse of history.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
