OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSATuring's legacy honoured 100 years
OL,4,Aon from school
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow, his former school and the wider
OL,7,Fcommunity have been exploring how his
OL,8,Fachievements helped shape modern
OL,9,Fcomputing and artificial intelligence
OL,10,F(AI), and how they might inspire the
OL,11,Fnext generation of innovators.
OL,13,FAfter travelling by ferry from France
OL,14,Fto Southampton in Hampshire, the young
OL,15,FTuring faced a problem getting to
OL,16,FSherborne because of disruption caused
OL,17,Fby the 1926 General Strike bringing
OL,18,Ftrains to a standstill.
